    "id": "rework_druid_feral",
    "title": "Feral Druid rework",
    "content": "Feral Druid covers cat damage and a bear tank with a damage mode. Bears gain Ironfur, Pulverize, Upheaval and Thrash. The Bestial Fury talent toggles a heavy-hitting bear DPS mode that builds Swell stacks and Tooth and Claw procs enabling Savage Bite, but locks out Ironfur, Savage Defense and Survival Instincts, so Bestial Fury is a damage role, not tanking. Cats gain Predatory Strikes, which makes healing spells instant in Cat Form.",
